{"text":"உண்ணும்","lemma":"உண்","gloss":"drinks"}],"gloss":"he drinks"},{"surface":"மன்னே","parts":[{"text":"மன்","lemma":"மன்","gloss":"king"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"the king indeed"},{"surface":"நன்றும்","parts":[{"text":"நன்று","lemma":"நன்று","gloss":"greatly"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"very much"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இன்னான்","parts":[{"text":"இன்னான்","lemma":"இன்னான்","gloss":"bad man"}],"gloss":"he is a bad man"},{"surface":"மன்ற","parts":[{"text":"மன்ற","lemma":"மன்ற","gloss":"certainly"}],"gloss":"certainly"},{"surface":"வேந்தே","parts":[{"text":"வேந்து","lemma":"வேந்து","gloss":"king"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"vocative"}],"gloss":"O king!"},{"surface":"இனியே","parts":[{"text":"இனியே","lemma":"இனியே","gloss":"now indeed"}],"gloss":"now indeed","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நேரார்","parts":[{"text":"நேரார்","lemma":"நேரார்","gloss":"enemies"}],"gloss":"enemies"},{"surface":"ஆரெயில்","parts":[{"text":"ஆர்","lemma":"ஆர்","gloss":"difficult"},{"text":"எயில்","lemma":"எயில்","gloss":"fortress"}],"gloss":"difficult fortress"},{"surface":"முற்றி","parts":[{"text":"முற்றி","lemma":"முற்று","gloss":"having besieged"}],"gloss":"having besieged"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வாய்","parts":[{"text":"வாய்","lemma":"வாய்","gloss":"mouth/lips"}],"gloss":"lips"},{"surface":"மடித்து","parts":[{"text":"மடித்து","lemma":"மடி","gloss":"having bitten/folded"}],"gloss":"having bitten"},{"surface":"உரறி","parts":[{"text":"உரறி","lemma":"உரறு","gloss":"having roared"}],"gloss":"having roared"},{"surface":"நீ","parts":[{"text":"நீ","lemma":"நீ","gloss":"you"}],"gloss":"you"},{"surface":"முந்து","parts":[{"text":"முந்து","lemma":"முந்து","gloss":"go first"}],"gloss":"go first"},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"say"}],"gloss":"say"},{"surface":"னானே","parts":[{"text":"னானே","lemma":"னானே","gloss":"he did not"}],"gloss":"he did not","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"To us indeed, turbid liquor he gives, he himself / clear liquor drinks, the king, greatly! / He is a bad man, certainly, the king, now! / Enemies' difficult fortress having besieged, / biting his lips, roaring, \"You go first!\" he did not say!","translation":"To us he gives the muddy dregs of the liquor, while he himself drinks the clear, filtered portion—how very bad our king has become now! For, when we besieged the enemies' formidable fortress, biting his lips and roaring, he never said to me, \"You go first!\"","modern":"எங்களுக்குக் கலங்கலான மதுவைத் தருகிறான், தான் மட்டும் தெளிந்த மதுவைக் குடிக்கிறான்; நம் அரசன் இப்போது மிகவும் கெட்டவன் ஆகிவிட்டான்! பகைவர்களின் அரிய கோட்டையை முற்றுகையிட்டு, உதட்டைக் கடித்துக் கர்ஜித்துக்கொண்டு, \"நீ முதலில் செல்!\" என்று அவன் எனக்குச் சொல்லவே இல்லை.","explanation":"This poem is a beautiful example of praise in the guise of blame (vanchap pukalchi) from the Puranaanooru collection. A warrior affectionately complains about his king's behavior during peace and war. In times of feasting, the king keeps the clear, refined liquor for himself and gives the thick, muddy dregs to his soldiers. But when war comes and they besiege the enemy's strong fortress, the king, biting his lips in fury and roaring, does not tell his soldiers to go first; instead, he rushes into the danger himself. The warrior humorously calls the king 'bad' (innaan) for this, but it actually highlights the king's supreme courage and protective love for his men, as he leads from the front rather than sending his soldiers to face death first.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.7],[0.7,1.3],[1.3,1.5],[1.5,1.9],[2.3,2.6],[2.6,2.9],[2.9,3.3],[3.3,4.09],[4.4,4.5],[4.5,5.0],[5.0,5.4],[5.4,6.3],[6.3,6.6],[6.6,6.8],[6.8,8.1],[8.1,8.4],[8.4,8.67],[8.8,9.1],[9.16,9.4],[9.4,9.52],[9.52,9.9]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.8],[0.8,1.4],[1.4,1.8],[1.8,2.7],[2.7,3.1],[3.1,3.3],[3.3,3.9],[3.9,4.74],[4.74,5.02],[5.02,5.3],[5.3,6.2],[6.2,7.2],[7.2,7.5],[7.5,7.7],[7.7,9.1],[9.1,9.4],[9.6,10.2],[10.4,10.62],[10.62,10.62],[10.62,10.62],[10.62,11.3]]},"sync":[[["எமக்கே","to us indeed"]],[["கலங்கல்","turbid liquor"]],[["தருமே","he gives indeed"]],[["தானே","he himself"]],[["தேறல்","clear liquor"]],[["உண்ணும்","he drinks"]],[["மன்னே","the king indeed"]],[["நன்றும்","very much"]],[["இன்னான்","he is a bad man"]],[["மன்ற","certainly"]],[["வேந்தே","O king!"]],[["இனியே","now indeed"]],[["நேரார்","enemies"]],[["ஆரெயில்","difficult fortress"]],[["முற்றி","having besieged"]],[["வாய்","lips"]],[["மடித்து","having bitten"]],[["உரறி","having roared"]],[["நீ","you"]],[["முந்து","go first"]],[["என்","say"]],[["னானே","he did not"]]]}